php-src's backport of PCRE2 794245e ("match: also restore originally unset
entries in recursion", PCRE2 pull request 300, first released in 10.43),
committed to the bundled copy as php-src 83a505e85f9 ("Fix GH-11374:
Different preg_match result with -d pcre.jit=0"). php-src carries it in its
bundled 10.39 from 8.1.26 and in its bundled 10.42 from 8.3.0; the browser's
engines run the interpreter, never the JIT, so the trace module of those
releases carries it too. The hunk is php-src's, the path PCRE2's.

